<title>SWEDEN: Graninge, Danish Elsam in power deal.</title>
<headline>Graninge, Danish Elsam in power deal.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish power group Graninge said on Friday its power division had signed a deal with the Danish electricity producer  Elsam under which Graninge will buy approximately 400 GWh of power from Elsam in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;Successful marketing and increased market share means that our own production needs to be complemented,&quot; Graninge said in a statement.</p>
<p>Elsam is the leading player on the power market in the Jutland region. Its production is based on fossil fuels.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
